# Daily Bellhaven -> CRM sync. Install with `crontab -e` on the machine that also runs the review app
# (both share data/sync.db, which is what keeps already-decided proposals from coming back).
#
# 06:15 every day: early enough that the queue is ready before the sales day starts.
# The run only reads the website and CRM and queues proposals. It never writes to the CRM.
# A failed run exits non-zero and logs the reason; set MAILTO to get that by email.

MAILTO=revops-alerts@example.com
15 6 * * * cd /opt/bellhaven-sync && .venv/bin/python run_pipeline.py >> data/pipeline.log 2>&1

# Windows equivalent (Task Scheduler):
#   schtasks /Create /SC DAILY /ST 06:15 /TN "bellhaven-sync" /TR "cmd /c cd /d C:\bellhaven-sync && .venv\Scripts\python run_pipeline.py >> data\pipeline.log 2>&1"
